<title>USA: Saratoga Brands sets spinoff record date.</title>
<headline>Saratoga Brands sets spinoff record date.</headline>
<dateline>LAKEWOOD, N.J. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saratoga Brands Inc said Thursday its board of directors approved November 12 as the record date for the spin-off of its mobile catering and food distribution business.</p>
<p>The mobile catering business will be distributed to the shareholders of Saratoga in the form of a dividend and is expected to be tax free</p>
<p>Saratoga said it will continue to be listed on the Nasdaq Small Cap market system. The mobile catering business is expected to immediately qualify, and seek, a Nasdaq Small Cap listing.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk  (212) 859-1610</p>
</text>
